tyType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"閱讀更多\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:閱讀更多;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/news/assorted/well-health-names-evelyn-sutherland-as-cfo-effective-sept-21-432SI-4893048?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">閱讀更多</a>（2026年9月8日）</p></li><li class=\"ml-4 list-disc\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Descartes Systems Group Inc因業績大幅超預期、EBITDA創歷史新高及連串收購消息而股價上揚。<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"閱讀更多\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:閱讀更多;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/why-is-descartes-systems-stock-surging-today-93CH-4898243?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">閱讀更多</a>（2026年9月11日）</p></li><li class=\"ml-4 list-disc\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Element Fleet Management Corp宣布退出備受矚目的Fleetpartners競購戰，重新聚焦核心業務。<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"閱讀更多\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:閱讀更多;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/news/stock-market-news/why-is-fleetpartners-stock-surging-today-93CH-4898811?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">閱讀更多</a>（2026年9月14日）</p></li><li class=\"ml-4 list-disc\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Lightspeed Commerce Inc推出全新ShipStation整合功能，擴大零售履約能力。<a data-yga='{\"yInteractivityType\":\"0\",\"yLinkElement\":\"context_link\",\"yLinkText\":\"閱讀更多\",\"yModuleName\":\"content-canvas\"}' data-ylk=\"slk:閱讀更多;elm:context_link;itc:0;sec:content-canvas;\" href=\"https://hk.investing.com/news/assorted/lightspeed-and-shipstation-launch-retail-fulfillment-integration-432SI-4887696?utm_medium=feed&amp;utm_source=yahoo&amp;utm_campaign=yahoo-hk\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\">閱讀更多</a>（2026年9月2日）</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"mb-module-gap leading-[1.35] text-px22 font-bold lg:text-px24 text-batcave\"><strong>深度解讀：漲勢背後的真正邏輯</strong></h2><ul class=\"mb-module-gap\"><li class=\"ml-4 list-disc\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">TALA及Amerigo Resources Ltd等礦業及資源股漲幅突出，但兩者均屬高風險——持續虧損與顯著波動性不容忽視。</p></li><li class=\"ml-4 list-disc\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">科技股（Constellation Software Inc、Descartes Systems Group Inc、WELL Health Technologies Corp、Lightspeed Commerce Inc）受消息面及業績驅動反彈，但並非所有個股均具備維持升勢的財務實力。</p></li><li class=\"ml-4 list-disc\"><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Amerigo Resources Ltd及WELL Health Technologies Corp成交量急增，顯示市場交投興趣濃厚——需留意成交量回落後可能出現的反轉風險。</p></li></ul><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Pro+方案的歷史數據查詢上限為10年。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-4ba58d55-f0ce-345d-8f47-c61aad2a26d5-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>